    rdfs:comment "An nbn Ethernet (Satellite) Ordered Product which allows RSP to conduct testing of applications, RSP Products, the RSP Network and the RSP Platform in connection with the Satellite Network. [extension: nbn Ethernet Product Module, Section 7(a), p.20]" .

