        "The range of S-TAG values associated with an NNI Link. Start of pool greater than or equal to 1; end of pool less than or equal to 4000. [extension: Wholesale Broadband Agreement - Product Technical Specification - nbn Ethernet Product Module, Table 13, page 43]" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf ns1:S_TAG_Pool .

ns1:S-TAGPool_Example a ns1:S-TAGPool,
